#MOBILE
Vnum       40501
Keywords   lha-mi lha mi master temple~
Short      Lha-Mi~
Long       Lha-Mi moves through a training form, unhurried and precise.
~
Desc       Lha-Mi, Master of Stav Kesh, has never been seen to move a
single wasted motion. Initiates say watching her train is more
instructive than a month of lectures - assuming you can keep up long
enough to watch closely.
~
