#ROOM
Vnum     40501
Name     Stav Kesh Landing Pad~
Sector   mountain~
Flags    can_land~
Desc     Wind-driven snow scours this narrow landing pad, carved into a
shelf of rock high in the Ice Giant Range. The air is thin and
bitterly cold, and the only shelter in sight is a switchback path
leading further up the mountainside.
~
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40502
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40921
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40502
Name     Icy Mountain Path~
Sector   mountain~
Flags    ~
Desc     A narrow path clings to the mountainside here, ice-slicked in
places and swept almost bare of snow in others where the wind cuts
hardest. Stav Kesh's walls are visible ahead, blending almost
seamlessly into the grey stone around them.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40501
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40503
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40503
Name     Gate of Stav Kesh~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Thick stone walls and a low, heavy door mark Stav Kesh's gate,
built to hold against the mountain's weather as much as anything
else. The warmth beyond the threshold is immediate and welcome.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40502
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40504
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40504
Name     Grand Training Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     A vast, high-ceilinged hall dominates the heart of Stav Kesh,
its floor worn smooth by generations of bare feet and practice
weapons alike. Initiates drill in loose formation, moving through
forms passed down since the Temple's founding.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40503
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction north~
ToRoom    40507
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40505
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40506
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40503 2 40504
Reset O 0 40501 5 40504
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40505
Name     Weapons Hall~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Racks of training weapons line every wall of this hall - staves,
blunted blades, and a scattering of stranger implements few initiates
recognize on sight. Every weapon here has a form built around it, and
Stav Kesh expects its students to learn several.
~
#EXIT
Direction west~
ToRoom    40504
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40502 1 40505
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40506
Name     Unarmed Combat Yard~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Padded mats cover the floor of this open yard, scuffed and
worn from constant use. Here, initiates learn that the body itself is
a weapon long before they're trusted with anything sharper.
~
#EXIT
Direction east~
ToRoom    40504
#ENDEXIT
#EXIT
Direction up~
ToRoom    40508
#ENDEXIT

Reset O 0 40502 3 40506
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40507
Name     Lha-Mi's Chamber~
Sector   inside~
Flags    indoors~
Desc     Spare and disciplined, this chamber holds little beyond a
sleeping mat and a single rack of weapons, each one kept in
immaculate condition. Lha-Mi's quarters reflect her training as
plainly as her movements do.
~
#EXIT
Direction south~
ToRoom    40504
#ENDEXIT

Reset M 0 40501 1 40507
#ENDROOM

#ROOM
Vnum     40508
Name     High Peak Overlook~
Sector   mountain~
Flags    ~
Desc     A narrow platform juts out from the mountainside here, high
enough that the training hall below is lost in cloud on all but the
clearest days. Initiates come here to test their focus against the
wind and the drop alike.
~
#EXIT
Direction down~
ToRoom    40506
#ENDEXIT
#ENDROOM

